{"lineas":[{"speaker":"David","start":0,"end":9.84,"text":"Okay, Alice, I have been dying to tell you this story all week, because it sounds like a scam and it's actually one of the most famous studies in medicine.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":0,"e":0.64},{"w":"Alice,","s":0.64,"e":1.28},{"w":"I","s":1.52,"e":1.76},{"w":"have","s":1.76,"e":1.92},{"w":"been","s":1.92,"e":2.16},{"w":"dying","s":2.16,"e":2.56},{"w":"to","s":2.56,"e":2.8},{"w":"tell","s":2.8,"e":3.04},{"w":"you","s":3.04,"e":3.2},{"w":"this","s":3.2,"e":3.36},{"w":"story","s":3.36,"e":3.76},{"w":"all","s":3.76,"e":4.16},{"w":"week,","s":4.16,"e":4.72},{"w":"because","s":4.8,"e":5.04},{"w":"it","s":5.04,"e":5.28},{"w":"sounds","s":5.28,"e":5.6},{"w":"like","s":5.6,"e":5.84},{"w":"a","s":5.84,"e":6},{"w":"scam","s":6,"e":6.4},{"w":"and","s":6.4,"e":6.72},{"w":"it's","s":6.72,"e":7.04},{"w":"actually","s":7.04,"e":7.36},{"w":"one","s":7.36,"e":7.6},{"w":"of","s":7.6,"e":7.68},{"w":"the","s":7.68,"e":7.84},{"w":"most","s":7.84,"e":8.08},{"w":"famous","s":8.08,"e":8.56},{"w":"studies","s":8.56,"e":8.88},{"w":"in","s":8.88,"e":9.12},{"w":"medicine.","s":9.12,"e":9.84}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":10,"end":20.495,"text":"That is a dangerous combination, David. Every time you say 'famous study,' I brace myself for something that got debunked five years later. So go ahead, impress me.","words":[{"w":"That","s":10,"e":10.4},{"w":"is","s":10.4,"e":10.64},{"w":"a","s":10.64,"e":10.8},{"w":"dangerous","s":10.8,"e":11.2},{"w":"combination,","s":11.2,"e":12},{"w":"David.","s":12,"e":12.32},{"w":"Every","s":12.735,"e":13.215},{"w":"time","s":13.215,"e":13.375},{"w":"you","s":13.375,"e":13.615},{"w":"say","s":13.615,"e":13.775},{"w":"'famous","s":13.775,"e":14.375},{"w":"study,'","s":14.375,"e":14.975},{"w":"I","s":14.975,"e":15.135},{"w":"brace","s":15.135,"e":15.535},{"w":"myself","s":15.535,"e":16.015},{"w":"for","s":16.015,"e":16.175},{"w":"something","s":16.175,"e":16.495},{"w":"that","s":16.495,"e":16.655},{"w":"got","s":16.655,"e":16.895},{"w":"debunked","s":16.895,"e":17.455},{"w":"five","s":17.455,"e":17.695},{"w":"years","s":17.695,"e":18.015},{"w":"later.","s":18.015,"e":18.575},{"w":"So","s":18.735,"e":18.895},{"w":"go","s":18.895,"e":19.135},{"w":"ahead,","s":19.135,"e":19.615},{"w":"impress","s":19.615,"e":19.935},{"w":"me.","s":19.935,"e":20.495}]},{"speaker":"David","start":20.655,"end":33.25,"text":"In 2002, a surgeon in Houston took patients with painful arthritic knees, made real incisions, pretended to operate, stitched them up, and sent them home. Fake surgery.","words":[{"w":"In","s":20.655,"e":21.135},{"w":"2002,","s":21.135,"e":22.495},{"w":"a","s":22.495,"e":22.655},{"w":"surgeon","s":22.655,"e":23.055},{"w":"in","s":23.055,"e":23.215},{"w":"Houston","s":23.215,"e":23.775},{"w":"took","s":23.775,"e":24.255},{"w":"patients","s":24.255,"e":24.655},{"w":"with","s":24.655,"e":24.975},{"w":"painful","s":24.975,"e":25.535},{"w":"arthritic","s":25.535,"e":26.015},{"w":"knees,","s":26.015,"e":26.415},{"w":"made","s":26.77,"e":27.09},{"w":"real","s":27.09,"e":27.41},{"w":"incisions,","s":27.41,"e":28.29},{"w":"pretended","s":28.37,"e":28.93},{"w":"to","s":28.93,"e":29.09},{"w":"operate,","s":29.09,"e":29.73},{"w":"stitched","s":29.73,"e":30.21},{"w":"them","s":30.21,"e":30.37},{"w":"up,","s":30.37,"e":30.77},{"w":"and","s":30.77,"e":30.85},{"w":"sent","s":30.85,"e":31.17},{"w":"them","s":31.17,"e":31.33},{"w":"home.","s":31.33,"e":31.89},{"w":"Fake","s":32.13,"e":32.53},{"w":"surgery.","s":32.53,"e":33.25}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":33.41,"end":44.255,"text":"Hold on, hold on. He cut people open, did absolutely nothing inside, and closed them? I'm sorry, but where I come from that's called fraud, not medicine.","words":[{"w":"Hold","s":33.41,"e":33.73},{"w":"on,","s":33.73,"e":34.13},{"w":"hold","s":34.13,"e":34.45},{"w":"on.","s":34.45,"e":34.93},{"w":"He","s":34.93,"e":35.17},{"w":"cut","s":35.17,"e":35.41},{"w":"people","s":35.41,"e":35.81},{"w":"open,","s":35.81,"e":36.37},{"w":"did","s":36.37,"e":36.61},{"w":"absolutely","s":36.61,"e":37.33},{"w":"nothing","s":37.33,"e":37.73},{"w":"inside,","s":37.73,"e":38.45},{"w":"and","s":38.45,"e":38.53},{"w":"closed","s":38.53,"e":38.93},{"w":"them?","s":38.93,"e":39.17},{"w":"I'm","s":39.935,"e":40.335},{"w":"sorry,","s":40.335,"e":40.895},{"w":"but","s":40.895,"e":41.055},{"w":"where","s":41.055,"e":41.295},{"w":"I","s":41.295,"e":41.535},{"w":"come","s":41.535,"e":41.695},{"w":"from","s":41.695,"e":42.095},{"w":"that's","s":42.095,"e":42.335},{"w":"called","s":42.335,"e":42.495},{"w":"fraud,","s":42.495,"e":43.295},{"w":"not","s":43.295,"e":43.455},{"w":"medicine.","s":43.455,"e":44.255}]},{"speaker":"David","start":44.575,"end":54.175,"text":"That's the twist — it was an official trial, published in the New England Journal of Medicine. A hundred and eighty patients agreed, knowing they might get the fake version.","words":[{"w":"That's","s":44.575,"e":44.975},{"w":"the","s":44.975,"e":45.135},{"w":"twist","s":45.135,"e":45.695},{"w":"—","s":45.695,"e":45.735},{"w":"it","s":45.695,"e":45.855},{"w":"was","s":45.855,"e":46.015},{"w":"an","s":46.015,"e":46.175},{"w":"official","s":46.175,"e":46.655},{"w":"trial,","s":46.655,"e":47.215},{"w":"published","s":47.215,"e":47.695},{"w":"in","s":47.695,"e":47.855},{"w":"the","s":47.855,"e":48.015},{"w":"New","s":48.015,"e":48.255},{"w":"England","s":48.255,"e":48.495},{"w":"Journal","s":48.495,"e":48.895},{"w":"of","s":48.895,"e":49.135},{"w":"Medicine.","s":49.135,"e":49.775},{"w":"A","s":50.095,"e":50.335},{"w":"hundred","s":50.335,"e":50.575},{"w":"and","s":50.575,"e":50.815},{"w":"eighty","s":50.815,"e":51.135},{"w":"patients","s":51.135,"e":51.535},{"w":"agreed,","s":51.535,"e":52.415},{"w":"knowing","s":52.495,"e":52.735},{"w":"they","s":52.735,"e":52.975},{"w":"might","s":52.975,"e":53.215},{"w":"get","s":53.215,"e":53.375},{"w":"the","s":53.375,"e":53.535},{"w":"fake","s":53.535,"e":53.855},{"w":"version.","s":53.855,"e":54.175}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":54.7,"end":66.78,"text":"Okay, consent changes things, I'll admit that. But I'm still skeptical, because agreeing to maybe-fake surgery and actually improving afterward are two very different animals, my friend.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":54.7,"e":55.34},{"w":"consent","s":55.42,"e":55.98},{"w":"changes","s":55.98,"e":56.62},{"w":"things,","s":56.62,"e":57.26},{"w":"I'll","s":57.26,"e":57.5},{"w":"admit","s":57.5,"e":57.82},{"w":"that.","s":57.82,"e":58.38},{"w":"But","s":58.46,"e":58.7},{"w":"I'm","s":58.7,"e":58.86},{"w":"still","s":58.86,"e":59.1},{"w":"skeptical,","s":59.1,"e":59.98},{"w":"because","s":60.14,"e":60.3},{"w":"agreeing","s":60.3,"e":60.78},{"w":"to","s":60.78,"e":61.02},{"w":"maybe-fake","s":61.02,"e":61.74},{"w":"surgery","s":61.74,"e":62.38},{"w":"and","s":62.38,"e":62.7},{"w":"actually","s":62.7,"e":63.18},{"w":"improving","s":63.18,"e":63.74},{"w":"afterward","s":63.74,"e":64.46},{"w":"are","s":64.46,"e":64.78},{"w":"two","s":64.78,"e":65.02},{"w":"very","s":65.02,"e":65.42},{"w":"different","s":65.42,"e":65.74},{"w":"animals,","s":65.74,"e":66.38},{"w":"my","s":66.38,"e":66.54},{"w":"friend.","s":66.54,"e":66.78}]},{"speaker":"David","start":67.285,"end":77.765,"text":"And yet they improved! For two years, the fake-surgery group reported just as little pain and just as much function as the people who went under the knife for real.","words":[{"w":"And","s":67.285,"e":67.525},{"w":"yet","s":67.525,"e":67.765},{"w":"they","s":67.765,"e":68.005},{"w":"improved!","s":68.005,"e":68.805},{"w":"For","s":69.125,"e":69.365},{"w":"two","s":69.365,"e":69.605},{"w":"years,","s":69.605,"e":70.165},{"w":"the","s":70.245,"e":70.405},{"w":"fake-surgery","s":70.405,"e":71.205},{"w":"group","s":71.205,"e":71.525},{"w":"reported","s":71.525,"e":72.165},{"w":"just","s":72.165,"e":72.485},{"w":"as","s":72.485,"e":72.645},{"w":"little","s":72.645,"e":72.965},{"w":"pain","s":72.965,"e":73.365},{"w":"and","s":73.365,"e":73.765},{"w":"just","s":73.765,"e":74.005},{"w":"as","s":74.005,"e":74.245},{"w":"much","s":74.245,"e":74.485},{"w":"function","s":74.485,"e":74.965},{"w":"as","s":74.965,"e":75.285},{"w":"the","s":75.285,"e":75.445},{"w":"people","s":75.445,"e":75.765},{"w":"who","s":75.765,"e":75.925},{"w":"went","s":75.925,"e":76.165},{"w":"under","s":76.165,"e":76.485},{"w":"the","s":76.485,"e":76.645},{"w":"knife","s":76.645,"e":76.885},{"w":"for","s":76.885,"e":77.205},{"w":"real.","s":77.205,"e":77.765}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":77.925,"end":87.75,"text":"Wait, wait — 'went under the knife.' I love that you slipped that in there, because it's exactly the phrase our listeners need. Under the knife means having surgery.","words":[{"w":"Wait,","s":77.925,"e":78.565},{"w":"wait","s":78.565,"e":78.885},{"w":"—","s":78.885,"e":79.005},{"w":"'went","s":79.005,"e":79.125},{"w":"under","s":79.125,"e":79.445},{"w":"the","s":79.445,"e":79.605},{"w":"knife.'","s":79.605,"e":80.47},{"w":"I","s":80.47,"e":80.79},{"w":"love","s":80.79,"e":80.95},{"w":"that","s":80.95,"e":81.19},{"w":"you","s":81.19,"e":81.35},{"w":"slipped","s":81.35,"e":81.67},{"w":"that","s":81.67,"e":81.83},{"w":"in","s":81.83,"e":82.07},{"w":"there,","s":82.07,"e":82.39},{"w":"because","s":82.39,"e":82.79},{"w":"it's","s":82.79,"e":83.03},{"w":"exactly","s":83.03,"e":83.43},{"w":"the","s":83.43,"e":83.59},{"w":"phrase","s":83.59,"e":83.91},{"w":"our","s":83.91,"e":84.23},{"w":"listeners","s":84.23,"e":84.63},{"w":"need.","s":84.63,"e":85.19},{"w":"Under","s":85.43,"e":85.83},{"w":"the","s":85.83,"e":85.99},{"w":"knife","s":85.99,"e":86.23},{"w":"means","s":86.23,"e":86.63},{"w":"having","s":86.63,"e":87.03},{"w":"surgery.","s":87.03,"e":87.75}]},{"speaker":"David","start":88.31,"end":98.025,"text":"Right, and it's always 'go under the knife' or 'be under the knife.' It sounds dramatic because it is — people say it when the surgery feels like a big deal.","words":[{"w":"Right,","s":88.31,"e":88.79},{"w":"and","s":88.79,"e":88.95},{"w":"it's","s":88.95,"e":89.19},{"w":"always","s":89.19,"e":89.51},{"w":"'go","s":89.51,"e":89.91},{"w":"under","s":89.91,"e":90.23},{"w":"the","s":90.23,"e":90.39},{"w":"knife'","s":90.39,"e":90.79},{"w":"or","s":90.79,"e":91.11},{"w":"'be","s":91.11,"e":91.51},{"w":"under","s":91.51,"e":91.83},{"w":"the","s":91.83,"e":91.99},{"w":"knife.'","s":91.99,"e":92.665},{"w":"It","s":92.665,"e":92.905},{"w":"sounds","s":92.905,"e":93.225},{"w":"dramatic","s":93.225,"e":93.865},{"w":"because","s":93.865,"e":94.265},{"w":"it","s":94.265,"e":94.425},{"w":"is","s":94.425,"e":94.905},{"w":"—","s":94.905,"e":94.985},{"w":"people","s":94.985,"e":95.305},{"w":"say","s":95.305,"e":95.545},{"w":"it","s":95.545,"e":95.705},{"w":"when","s":95.705,"e":95.945},{"w":"the","s":95.945,"e":96.105},{"w":"surgery","s":96.105,"e":96.505},{"w":"feels","s":96.505,"e":96.905},{"w":"like","s":96.905,"e":97.065},{"w":"a","s":97.065,"e":97.225},{"w":"big","s":97.225,"e":97.465},{"w":"deal.","s":97.465,"e":98.025}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":98.265,"end":103.865,"text":"Like, 'my aunt refused to go under the knife for her back, she'd rather just complain about it forever.'","words":[{"w":"Like,","s":98.265,"e":98.905},{"w":"'my","s":98.905,"e":99.465},{"w":"aunt","s":99.465,"e":99.785},{"w":"refused","s":99.785,"e":100.265},{"w":"to","s":100.265,"e":100.425},{"w":"go","s":100.425,"e":100.585},{"w":"under","s":100.585,"e":100.825},{"w":"the","s":100.825,"e":100.985},{"w":"knife","s":100.985,"e":101.225},{"w":"for","s":101.225,"e":101.465},{"w":"her","s":101.465,"e":101.625},{"w":"back,","s":101.625,"e":102.185},{"w":"she'd","s":102.185,"e":102.505},{"w":"rather","s":102.505,"e":102.745},{"w":"just","s":102.745,"e":102.985},{"w":"complain","s":102.985,"e":103.385},{"w":"about","s":103.385,"e":103.625},{"w":"it","s":103.625,"e":103.865},{"w":"forever.'","s":103.865,"e":103.905}]},{"speaker":"David","start":104.68,"end":115.96,"text":"Exactly. And these patients did go under the knife, technically. Real incisions, real stitches, a real scar. Their brains had every reason to believe the knee was fixed.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":104.68,"e":105.56},{"w":"And","s":105.72,"e":105.88},{"w":"these","s":105.88,"e":106.12},{"w":"patients","s":106.12,"e":106.52},{"w":"did","s":106.52,"e":106.84},{"w":"go","s":106.84,"e":107.08},{"w":"under","s":107.08,"e":107.32},{"w":"the","s":107.32,"e":107.48},{"w":"knife,","s":107.48,"e":108.04},{"w":"technically.","s":108.04,"e":108.76},{"w":"Real","s":109,"e":109.32},{"w":"incisions,","s":109.32,"e":110.2},{"w":"real","s":110.28,"e":110.6},{"w":"stitches,","s":110.6,"e":111.4},{"w":"a","s":111.4,"e":111.56},{"w":"real","s":111.56,"e":111.8},{"w":"scar.","s":111.8,"e":112.52},{"w":"Their","s":112.68,"e":113},{"w":"brains","s":113,"e":113.32},{"w":"had","s":113.32,"e":113.56},{"w":"every","s":113.56,"e":113.88},{"w":"reason","s":113.88,"e":114.2},{"w":"to","s":114.2,"e":114.36},{"w":"believe","s":114.36,"e":114.68},{"w":"the","s":114.68,"e":114.84},{"w":"knee","s":114.84,"e":115.08},{"w":"was","s":115.08,"e":115.32},{"w":"fixed.","s":115.32,"e":115.96}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":116.04,"end":125.355,"text":"See, this is where you lose me. Pain is not a mood, David. There was arthritis in those knees before the operation, and there was arthritis after.","words":[{"w":"See,","s":116.04,"e":116.6},{"w":"this","s":116.6,"e":116.68},{"w":"is","s":116.68,"e":116.76},{"w":"where","s":116.76,"e":117},{"w":"you","s":117,"e":117.16},{"w":"lose","s":117.16,"e":117.4},{"w":"me.","s":117.4,"e":117.64},{"w":"Pain","s":118.155,"e":118.475},{"w":"is","s":118.475,"e":118.715},{"w":"not","s":118.715,"e":118.955},{"w":"a","s":118.955,"e":119.115},{"w":"mood,","s":119.115,"e":119.595},{"w":"David.","s":119.595,"e":120.235},{"w":"There","s":120.475,"e":120.635},{"w":"was","s":120.635,"e":120.795},{"w":"arthritis","s":120.795,"e":121.355},{"w":"in","s":121.355,"e":121.675},{"w":"those","s":121.675,"e":121.835},{"w":"knees","s":121.835,"e":122.155},{"w":"before","s":122.155,"e":122.475},{"w":"the","s":122.475,"e":122.715},{"w":"operation,","s":122.715,"e":123.435},{"w":"and","s":123.595,"e":123.755},{"w":"there","s":123.755,"e":123.915},{"w":"was","s":123.915,"e":124.075},{"w":"arthritis","s":124.075,"e":124.635},{"w":"after.","s":124.635,"e":125.355}]},{"speaker":"David","start":125.675,"end":136.12,"text":"True, the cartilage didn't change at all. But the pain did. That's the placebo effect at full power. Mind over matter, in the most literal sense possible.","words":[{"w":"True,","s":125.675,"e":126.235},{"w":"the","s":126.315,"e":126.555},{"w":"cartilage","s":126.555,"e":127.115},{"w":"didn't","s":127.115,"e":127.435},{"w":"change","s":127.435,"e":127.835},{"w":"at","s":127.835,"e":127.995},{"w":"all.","s":127.995,"e":128.475},{"w":"But","s":128.715,"e":128.875},{"w":"the","s":128.875,"e":129.035},{"w":"pain","s":129.035,"e":129.355},{"w":"did.","s":129.355,"e":129.995},{"w":"That's","s":130.155,"e":130.555},{"w":"the","s":130.555,"e":130.635},{"w":"placebo","s":130.635,"e":131.195},{"w":"effect","s":131.195,"e":131.595},{"w":"at","s":131.595,"e":131.755},{"w":"full","s":131.755,"e":132.075},{"w":"power.","s":132.075,"e":132.395},{"w":"Mind","s":132.84,"e":133.16},{"w":"over","s":133.16,"e":133.48},{"w":"matter,","s":133.48,"e":134.12},{"w":"in","s":134.12,"e":134.28},{"w":"the","s":134.28,"e":134.36},{"w":"most","s":134.36,"e":134.6},{"w":"literal","s":134.6,"e":135.08},{"w":"sense","s":135.08,"e":135.4},{"w":"possible.","s":135.4,"e":136.12}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":136.44,"end":146.2,"text":"Ah, there it is — mind over matter. That's when your thoughts or your willpower overcome something physical. Pain, exhaustion, fear.","words":[{"w":"Ah,","s":136.44,"e":137.08},{"w":"there","s":137.08,"e":137.48},{"w":"it","s":137.48,"e":137.64},{"w":"is","s":137.64,"e":138.2},{"w":"—","s":138.2,"e":138.28},{"w":"mind","s":138.28,"e":138.6},{"w":"over","s":138.6,"e":138.92},{"w":"matter.","s":138.92,"e":139.56},{"w":"That's","s":139.64,"e":139.96},{"w":"when","s":139.96,"e":140.2},{"w":"your","s":140.2,"e":140.44},{"w":"thoughts","s":140.44,"e":140.76},{"w":"or","s":140.76,"e":141.08},{"w":"your","s":141.08,"e":141.32},{"w":"willpower","s":141.32,"e":142.12},{"w":"overcome","s":142.12,"e":142.68},{"w":"something","s":142.68,"e":143.16},{"w":"physical.","s":143.16,"e":143.96},{"w":"Pain,","s":144.12,"e":144.76},{"w":"exhaustion,","s":144.84,"e":145.8},{"w":"fear.","s":145.8,"e":146.2}]},{"speaker":"David","start":146.605,"end":150.605,"text":"Like running the last mile of a marathon on pure stubbornness.","words":[{"w":"Like","s":146.605,"e":146.845},{"w":"running","s":146.845,"e":147.245},{"w":"the","s":147.245,"e":147.405},{"w":"last","s":147.405,"e":147.725},{"w":"mile","s":147.725,"e":148.045},{"w":"of","s":148.045,"e":148.205},{"w":"a","s":148.205,"e":148.365},{"w":"marathon","s":148.365,"e":148.925},{"w":"on","s":148.925,"e":149.245},{"w":"pure","s":149.245,"e":149.645},{"w":"stubbornness.","s":149.645,"e":150.605}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":150.765,"end":157.405,"text":"Or sitting through all four hours of your vacation photos. That was mind over matter, believe me.","words":[{"w":"Or","s":150.765,"e":151.405},{"w":"sitting","s":151.565,"e":151.965},{"w":"through","s":151.965,"e":152.285},{"w":"all","s":152.285,"e":152.525},{"w":"four","s":152.525,"e":152.765},{"w":"hours","s":152.765,"e":153.085},{"w":"of","s":153.085,"e":153.245},{"w":"your","s":153.245,"e":153.485},{"w":"vacation","s":153.485,"e":154.045},{"w":"photos.","s":154.045,"e":154.845},{"w":"That","s":155.085,"e":155.325},{"w":"was","s":155.325,"e":155.565},{"w":"mind","s":155.565,"e":155.885},{"w":"over","s":155.885,"e":156.125},{"w":"matter,","s":156.125,"e":156.685},{"w":"believe","s":156.685,"e":156.925},{"w":"me.","s":156.925,"e":157.405}]},{"speaker":"David","start":157.405,"end":158.685,"text":"Rude. But fair.","words":[{"w":"Rude.","s":157.405,"e":158.125},{"w":"But","s":158.205,"e":158.365},{"w":"fair.","s":158.365,"e":158.685}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":159.06,"end":169.38,"text":"Here's my real objection, though. Before you declare a miracle, you have to rule out the boring explanations. Maybe those knees were simply going to improve on their own.","words":[{"w":"Here's","s":159.06,"e":159.62},{"w":"my","s":159.62,"e":159.78},{"w":"real","s":159.78,"e":160.1},{"w":"objection,","s":160.1,"e":160.58},{"w":"though.","s":160.58,"e":161.22},{"w":"Before","s":161.22,"e":161.62},{"w":"you","s":161.62,"e":161.78},{"w":"declare","s":161.78,"e":162.18},{"w":"a","s":162.18,"e":162.34},{"w":"miracle,","s":162.34,"e":163.06},{"w":"you","s":163.14,"e":163.3},{"w":"have","s":163.3,"e":163.46},{"w":"to","s":163.46,"e":163.62},{"w":"rule","s":163.62,"e":163.94},{"w":"out","s":163.94,"e":164.1},{"w":"the","s":164.1,"e":164.34},{"w":"boring","s":164.34,"e":164.82},{"w":"explanations.","s":164.82,"e":165.86},{"w":"Maybe","s":166.18,"e":166.5},{"w":"those","s":166.5,"e":166.82},{"w":"knees","s":166.82,"e":167.14},{"w":"were","s":167.14,"e":167.38},{"w":"simply","s":167.38,"e":167.7},{"w":"going","s":167.7,"e":168.02},{"w":"to","s":168.02,"e":168.18},{"w":"improve","s":168.18,"e":168.58},{"w":"on","s":168.58,"e":168.74},{"w":"their","s":168.74,"e":168.9},{"w":"own.","s":168.9,"e":169.38}]},{"speaker":"David","start":169.7,"end":178.725,"text":"And she does it again — to rule out. To eliminate a possibility until only the truth is left. Doctors live by this phrase.","words":[{"w":"And","s":169.7,"e":169.94},{"w":"she","s":169.94,"e":170.1},{"w":"does","s":170.1,"e":170.34},{"w":"it","s":170.34,"e":170.5},{"w":"again","s":170.5,"e":171.14},{"w":"—","s":171.14,"e":171.22},{"w":"to","s":171.22,"e":171.38},{"w":"rule","s":171.38,"e":171.7},{"w":"out.","s":171.7,"e":171.94},{"w":"To","s":172.405,"e":172.725},{"w":"eliminate","s":172.725,"e":173.205},{"w":"a","s":173.205,"e":173.365},{"w":"possibility","s":173.365,"e":174.165},{"w":"until","s":174.165,"e":174.645},{"w":"only","s":174.645,"e":174.965},{"w":"the","s":174.965,"e":175.205},{"w":"truth","s":175.205,"e":175.525},{"w":"is","s":175.525,"e":175.685},{"w":"left.","s":175.685,"e":176.245},{"w":"Doctors","s":176.965,"e":177.365},{"w":"live","s":177.365,"e":177.765},{"w":"by","s":177.765,"e":177.925},{"w":"this","s":177.925,"e":178.165},{"w":"phrase.","s":178.165,"e":178.725}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":179.205,"end":183.525,"text":"'We've ruled out a fracture.' It's in every hospital drama ever filmed.","words":[{"w":"'We've","s":179.205,"e":179.245},{"w":"ruled","s":179.205,"e":179.525},{"w":"out","s":179.525,"e":179.685},{"w":"a","s":179.685,"e":179.845},{"w":"fracture.'","s":179.845,"e":180.725},{"w":"It's","s":180.725,"e":180.965},{"w":"in","s":180.965,"e":181.125},{"w":"every","s":181.125,"e":181.445},{"w":"hospital","s":181.445,"e":181.925},{"w":"drama","s":181.925,"e":182.405},{"w":"ever","s":182.405,"e":182.805},{"w":"filmed.","s":182.805,"e":183.525}]},{"speaker":"David","start":183.765,"end":195.71,"text":"But here's the thing — the trial was built to rule that out. Real surgery and fake surgery recovered the same. If time alone healed them, then the real operation added nothing.","words":[{"w":"But","s":183.765,"e":184.005},{"w":"here's","s":184.005,"e":184.325},{"w":"the","s":184.325,"e":184.485},{"w":"thing","s":184.485,"e":185.045},{"w":"—","s":185.045,"e":185.125},{"w":"the","s":185.125,"e":185.285},{"w":"trial","s":185.285,"e":185.685},{"w":"was","s":185.685,"e":185.925},{"w":"built","s":185.925,"e":186.325},{"w":"to","s":186.325,"e":186.485},{"w":"rule","s":186.485,"e":186.805},{"w":"that","s":186.805,"e":187.045},{"w":"out.","s":187.045,"e":187.285},{"w":"Real","s":187.79,"e":188.19},{"w":"surgery","s":188.19,"e":188.67},{"w":"and","s":188.67,"e":188.99},{"w":"fake","s":188.99,"e":189.31},{"w":"surgery","s":189.31,"e":190.03},{"w":"recovered","s":190.03,"e":190.51},{"w":"the","s":190.51,"e":190.83},{"w":"same.","s":190.83,"e":191.31},{"w":"If","s":191.63,"e":191.87},{"w":"time","s":191.87,"e":192.19},{"w":"alone","s":192.19,"e":192.51},{"w":"healed","s":192.51,"e":192.99},{"w":"them,","s":192.99,"e":193.47},{"w":"then","s":193.47,"e":193.63},{"w":"the","s":193.63,"e":193.79},{"w":"real","s":193.79,"e":194.11},{"w":"operation","s":194.11,"e":194.67},{"w":"added","s":194.67,"e":195.07},{"w":"nothing.","s":195.07,"e":195.71}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":196.11,"end":201.685,"text":"Which is honestly the darker headline. Not 'fake surgery works' — 'this real surgery doesn't.'","words":[{"w":"Which","s":196.11,"e":196.27},{"w":"is","s":196.27,"e":196.43},{"w":"honestly","s":196.43,"e":196.91},{"w":"the","s":196.91,"e":197.23},{"w":"darker","s":197.23,"e":197.63},{"w":"headline.","s":197.63,"e":198.43},{"w":"Not","s":198.67,"e":198.91},{"w":"'fake","s":198.91,"e":199.31},{"w":"surgery","s":199.31,"e":199.79},{"w":"works'","s":199.79,"e":200.128},{"w":"—","s":200.128,"e":200.466},{"w":"'this","s":200.466,"e":200.805},{"w":"real","s":200.805,"e":201.205},{"w":"surgery","s":201.205,"e":201.685},{"w":"doesn't.'","s":201.685,"e":201.725}]},{"speaker":"David","start":202.405,"end":209.685,"text":"And that procedure was incredibly common for arthritis at the time. This study landed like a bomb in orthopedics.","words":[{"w":"And","s":202.405,"e":202.565},{"w":"that","s":202.565,"e":202.805},{"w":"procedure","s":202.805,"e":203.365},{"w":"was","s":203.365,"e":203.605},{"w":"incredibly","s":203.605,"e":204.245},{"w":"common","s":204.245,"e":204.645},{"w":"for","s":204.645,"e":204.885},{"w":"arthritis","s":204.885,"e":205.525},{"w":"at","s":205.525,"e":205.765},{"w":"the","s":205.765,"e":205.925},{"w":"time.","s":205.925,"e":206.405},{"w":"This","s":206.725,"e":206.965},{"w":"study","s":206.965,"e":207.365},{"w":"landed","s":207.365,"e":207.845},{"w":"like","s":207.845,"e":208.005},{"w":"a","s":208.005,"e":208.165},{"w":"bomb","s":208.165,"e":208.485},{"w":"in","s":208.485,"e":208.645},{"w":"orthopedics.","s":208.645,"e":209.685}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":209.845,"end":218.53,"text":"Okay, so now the ethical part, because this is what actually keeps me up. If deception relieves real pain, is it ever okay to lie to a patient?","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":209.845,"e":210.485},{"w":"so","s":210.485,"e":210.645},{"w":"now","s":210.645,"e":210.805},{"w":"the","s":210.805,"e":211.045},{"w":"ethical","s":211.045,"e":211.445},{"w":"part,","s":211.445,"e":211.685},{"w":"because","s":211.685,"e":212.085},{"w":"this","s":212.085,"e":212.325},{"w":"is","s":212.325,"e":212.405},{"w":"what","s":212.405,"e":212.565},{"w":"actually","s":212.565,"e":212.885},{"w":"keeps","s":212.885,"e":213.205},{"w":"me","s":213.205,"e":213.365},{"w":"up.","s":213.365,"e":213.525},{"w":"If","s":214.05,"e":214.37},{"w":"deception","s":214.37,"e":214.93},{"w":"relieves","s":214.93,"e":215.33},{"w":"real","s":215.33,"e":215.73},{"w":"pain,","s":215.73,"e":216.29},{"w":"is","s":216.37,"e":216.53},{"w":"it","s":216.53,"e":216.69},{"w":"ever","s":216.69,"e":216.93},{"w":"okay","s":216.93,"e":217.33},{"w":"to","s":217.33,"e":217.49},{"w":"lie","s":217.49,"e":217.73},{"w":"to","s":217.73,"e":217.89},{"w":"a","s":217.89,"e":218.05},{"w":"patient?","s":218.05,"e":218.53}]},{"speaker":"David","start":218.53,"end":225.89,"text":"That's the delicious question, right? If I could cure your headache with a sugar pill, but only by lying about it, should I?","words":[{"w":"That's","s":218.53,"e":218.93},{"w":"the","s":218.93,"e":219.09},{"w":"delicious","s":219.09,"e":219.65},{"w":"question,","s":219.65,"e":220.29},{"w":"right?","s":220.29,"e":220.77},{"w":"If","s":221.01,"e":221.25},{"w":"I","s":221.25,"e":221.33},{"w":"could","s":221.33,"e":221.57},{"w":"cure","s":221.57,"e":221.81},{"w":"your","s":221.81,"e":222.05},{"w":"headache","s":222.05,"e":222.45},{"w":"with","s":222.45,"e":222.61},{"w":"a","s":222.61,"e":222.77},{"w":"sugar","s":222.77,"e":223.09},{"w":"pill,","s":223.09,"e":223.73},{"w":"but","s":223.73,"e":223.89},{"w":"only","s":223.89,"e":224.13},{"w":"by","s":224.13,"e":224.37},{"w":"lying","s":224.37,"e":224.77},{"w":"about","s":224.77,"e":225.01},{"w":"it,","s":225.01,"e":225.41},{"w":"should","s":225.41,"e":225.73},{"w":"I?","s":225.73,"e":225.89}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":226.405,"end":234.485,"text":"No. Trust is the entire foundation of medicine. You start lying for noble reasons, and eventually you're lying for convenient ones.","words":[{"w":"No.","s":226.405,"e":227.125},{"w":"Trust","s":227.205,"e":227.605},{"w":"is","s":227.605,"e":227.765},{"w":"the","s":227.765,"e":227.925},{"w":"entire","s":227.925,"e":228.405},{"w":"foundation","s":228.405,"e":228.885},{"w":"of","s":228.885,"e":229.045},{"w":"medicine.","s":229.045,"e":229.765},{"w":"You","s":229.925,"e":230.085},{"w":"start","s":230.085,"e":230.485},{"w":"lying","s":230.485,"e":230.805},{"w":"for","s":230.805,"e":230.965},{"w":"noble","s":230.965,"e":231.365},{"w":"reasons,","s":231.365,"e":232.085},{"w":"and","s":232.085,"e":232.165},{"w":"eventually","s":232.165,"e":232.645},{"w":"you're","s":232.645,"e":233.045},{"w":"lying","s":233.045,"e":233.285},{"w":"for","s":233.285,"e":233.445},{"w":"convenient","s":233.445,"e":234.005},{"w":"ones.","s":234.005,"e":234.485}]},{"speaker":"David","start":234.485,"end":240.005,"text":"Then hold on to your chair, because here's the final twist. You don't even need the lie.","words":[{"w":"Then","s":234.485,"e":234.805},{"w":"hold","s":234.805,"e":235.125},{"w":"on","s":235.125,"e":235.285},{"w":"to","s":235.285,"e":235.445},{"w":"your","s":235.445,"e":235.605},{"w":"chair,","s":235.605,"e":236.245},{"w":"because","s":236.325,"e":236.565},{"w":"here's","s":236.565,"e":236.885},{"w":"the","s":236.885,"e":237.045},{"w":"final","s":237.045,"e":237.445},{"w":"twist.","s":237.445,"e":238.085},{"w":"You","s":238.325,"e":238.565},{"w":"don't","s":238.565,"e":238.805},{"w":"even","s":238.805,"e":239.045},{"w":"need","s":239.045,"e":239.285},{"w":"the","s":239.285,"e":239.445},{"w":"lie.","s":239.445,"e":240.005}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":240.005,"end":241.205,"text":"Meaning what, exactly?","words":[{"w":"Meaning","s":240.005,"e":240.325},{"w":"what,","s":240.325,"e":240.885},{"w":"exactly?","s":240.885,"e":241.205}]},{"speaker":"David","start":242.67,"end":256.585,"text":"Open-label placebos. Honest ones. In 2010, Harvard researchers gave people with irritable bowel syndrome pills labeled 'placebo.' They told them straight: this is inert, like sugar, no medication inside.","words":[{"w":"Open-label","s":242.67,"e":242.70999999999998},{"w":"placebos.","s":242.67,"e":243.71},{"w":"Honest","s":243.87,"e":244.19},{"w":"ones.","s":244.19,"e":244.91},{"w":"In","s":244.99,"e":245.23},{"w":"2010,","s":245.23,"e":246.27},{"w":"Harvard","s":246.27,"e":246.67},{"w":"researchers","s":246.67,"e":247.31},{"w":"gave","s":247.31,"e":247.63},{"w":"people","s":247.63,"e":247.87},{"w":"with","s":247.87,"e":248.11},{"w":"irritable","s":248.11,"e":248.59},{"w":"bowel","s":248.59,"e":248.99},{"w":"syndrome","s":248.99,"e":249.39},{"w":"pills","s":249.39,"e":249.95},{"w":"labeled","s":249.95,"e":250.51},{"w":"'placebo.'","s":250.51,"e":251.63},{"w":"They","s":251.63,"e":251.87},{"w":"told","s":251.87,"e":252.11},{"w":"them","s":252.11,"e":252.27},{"w":"straight:","s":252.27,"e":252.99},{"w":"this","s":253.07,"e":253.31},{"w":"is","s":253.31,"e":253.55},{"w":"inert,","s":253.55,"e":253.95},{"w":"like","s":254.185,"e":254.505},{"w":"sugar,","s":254.505,"e":255.145},{"w":"no","s":255.145,"e":255.385},{"w":"medication","s":255.385,"e":255.945},{"w":"inside.","s":255.945,"e":256.585}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":256.585,"end":258.985,"text":"And it still worked? Come on.","words":[{"w":"And","s":256.585,"e":256.905},{"w":"it","s":256.905,"e":257.065},{"w":"still","s":257.065,"e":257.385},{"w":"worked?","s":257.385,"e":258.025},{"w":"Come","s":258.185,"e":258.505},{"w":"on.","s":258.505,"e":258.985}]},{"speaker":"David","start":259.225,"end":268.68,"text":"It did. The honest-placebo group reported significantly more improvement than patients who got no treatment. Knowing it was fake didn't kill the effect.","words":[{"w":"It","s":259.225,"e":259.545},{"w":"did.","s":259.545,"e":260.105},{"w":"The","s":260.265,"e":260.425},{"w":"honest-placebo","s":260.425,"e":261.385},{"w":"group","s":261.385,"e":261.865},{"w":"reported","s":261.865,"e":262.425},{"w":"significantly","s":262.425,"e":263.145},{"w":"more","s":263.145,"e":263.465},{"w":"improvement","s":263.465,"e":264.025},{"w":"than","s":264.025,"e":264.345},{"w":"patients","s":264.345,"e":264.745},{"w":"who","s":264.745,"e":264.985},{"w":"got","s":264.985,"e":265.145},{"w":"no","s":265.145,"e":265.385},{"w":"treatment.","s":265.385,"e":265.785},{"w":"Knowing","s":266.2,"e":266.6},{"w":"it","s":266.6,"e":266.76},{"w":"was","s":266.76,"e":266.92},{"w":"fake","s":266.92,"e":267.32},{"w":"didn't","s":267.32,"e":267.72},{"w":"kill","s":267.72,"e":268.04},{"w":"the","s":268.04,"e":268.2},{"w":"effect.","s":268.2,"e":268.68}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":268.68,"end":274.84,"text":"That genuinely breaks my brain a little. You know it's sugar, and your body responds anyway?","words":[{"w":"That","s":268.68,"e":269.08},{"w":"genuinely","s":269.08,"e":269.72},{"w":"breaks","s":269.72,"e":270.12},{"w":"my","s":270.12,"e":270.36},{"w":"brain","s":270.36,"e":270.6},{"w":"a","s":270.6,"e":270.76},{"w":"little.","s":270.76,"e":271.24},{"w":"You","s":271.56,"e":271.72},{"w":"know","s":271.72,"e":271.96},{"w":"it's","s":271.96,"e":272.2},{"w":"sugar,","s":272.2,"e":272.84},{"w":"and","s":272.92,"e":273.08},{"w":"your","s":273.08,"e":273.24},{"w":"body","s":273.24,"e":273.56},{"w":"responds","s":273.56,"e":274.04},{"w":"anyway?","s":274.04,"e":274.84}]},{"speaker":"David","start":275.24,"end":286.625,"text":"The ritual seems to matter — the bottle, the routine, someone caring for you. Your brain runs its own pharmacy, and apparently it accepts theater as a valid prescription.","words":[{"w":"The","s":275.24,"e":275.56},{"w"